{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或單持㘕字亦得，㘕或作囕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是梵書唵㘕字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "𡄦字當作離禁切，彈舌道之，或直音疾陵"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是梵書唵齒𡄦字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此亦唵齒𡄦字。原梵書兩種不同，亦如此方之隸篆也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以大\n母指屈在掌中，用後四指壓大母指上，急把拳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是梵書準提真言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "端坐結印"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "口誦真言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
