{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "半音"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上諸印，皆誦本部真言。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "微吉切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦作吠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無可切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此變食真言理趣功德，如下廣明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以大拇指、頭指、中指、小指舒，以無名指用攪食上，施諸仙食亦作此印"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能破餓鬼慳恡業，得福德圓滿。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能除餓鬼醜陋形，得色相具足。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能令餓鬼喉咽寬大，所施之食悉皆充足。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能除餓鬼一切怖畏，得離鬼道。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "淨石木上瓦器亦得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以梵漢字兼書之於鐘皷等上更妙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喉中擡聲引呼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "靺亦作韈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "○合口呼，胸喉中聲如牛吼。尾亦作吠、廢、微，左亦作遮者，母亦作畆，抳亦作儗。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "迦或作葛，抳或作禰，𩕳或作你。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欲作法加持結界，詳如五\n字心陀羅尼品。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦\n作毗布羅揭陛，尾又作肥，陛亦作鞞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "抳亦作尼去聲，囉亦作臘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "他上聲，多去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦作那捺你捨泥，又作達囉設你"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "抳亦作尼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蘇亦作素，囉亦作臘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦\n作肥摩麗，又作毗末梨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孽亦作竭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦作鉗鼻囇，又作鉗\n苾𠼝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦作什皤羅，又作什伐囉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦作勃陀嚩𡀔枳羝，又作勃陀毗路吉帝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "麌呬夜亦作矩醯耶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下是梵書，舊本多\n訛，今校正。若欲書於物上，須華梵兩存。然書華文，不必書其句下別譯之文。"}
