{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "○護，亦作胡都，\n亦作度只，亦作遮波，亦作婆哩，亦作尼去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "啞亦作阿"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是梵書唵啞吽字"}
